{"articleNo":"570801","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=570801&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[학적] 2026년도 2학기 이음 멘토링(복학생 적응 지원) '멘티' 모집 안내","writer":"학생과","writeDate":"2026.07.21","hit":"8035","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">년도 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">학기 이음 멘토링</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">복학생 적응지원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">) '</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">멘티</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">' </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">모집 안내</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">복학생의 학교 적응을 돕기 위해 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">년도 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">학기 이음멘토링 프로그램을 운영하오니&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">관심있는 학생들의 많은 지원 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">활동기간</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">:</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"> 2026</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">~ 12</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">월</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">모집기간</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">:</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"> 7.22.(</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">) ~ 8.21.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">), 18:00</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">까지 모집</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">이후 개별 연락</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">모집인원</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">:</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">멘티</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">복학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">약 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">80</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">명</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">활동내용</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">:</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">멘토와 멘티</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">소그룹</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">으로 매칭하여 14~</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">16</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">회기 소그룹 활동</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;[</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">학교 시스템 안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">학과 커리큘럼 및 교과목 정보제공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">,  </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">졸업요건 안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">비교과 프로그램 안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">심리지원 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">]</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">혜택</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">:</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"> BISKIT </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">마일리지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">최대 약&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">325</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">점</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">), </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">학교적응지원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">취업진로상담 교과목 수료</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">6. </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">신청 방법 </span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">구글폼 온라인 설문지를 작성하여 직접 제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(<a href=\"https://forms.gle/RLibTZisxp6YEj67A\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\">https://forms.gle/RLibTZisxp6YEj67A</a>)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">7. </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">관련 문의</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">:</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">  </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">학생상담센터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">☎ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">054-478-7934)</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"12390\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.0\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"9, 1, 1, 5656\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_Unknown_Version\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"\",\n\"su\": \"\",\n\"de\": \"\",\n\"cd\": \"2026-07-21T14:18:54.930Z\",\n\"md\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"pd\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"ke\": \"\"\n}\n},\n\"dh\": {\n\"do\": {\n\"pa\": 1,\n\"fo\": 1,\n\"en\": 1,\n\"pi\": 1,\n\"tb\": 1,\n\"eq\": 1\n},\n\"fo\": [ ],\n\"cd\": {\n\"tp\": 0,\n\"lc\": {\n\"af\": false,\n\"ui\": false,\n\"fu\": false,\n\"dn\": false,\n\"ul\": false,\n\"el\": false,\n\"at\": false,\n\"tq\": false,\n\"da\": false,\n\"dw\": false,\n\"dj\": false,\n\"bc\": false,\n\"bu\": false,\n\"al\": false,\n\"ab\": false,\n\"ap\": false,\n\"an\": false,\n\"aa\": false,\n\"ds\": false,\n\"de